@tradition sunrise-stretch
// Mon, Wed, Fri 06:30, along the promenade windows (Deck 3). A gentle group stretch before breakfast. Anyone can join.
== mail
- Sunrise stretch at {time}, along the promenade windows. Gentle, slow, done before breakfast. Come in what you slept in.
== ask
- Sunrise stretch in the morning? Gentle. I promise.
- Stretch before breakfast? Wakes you up better than tea.
== here
- Reach up. And down. And groan quietly.   #funny
- Look out the window while you stretch. Lovely start.
- My knees say no. My knees are outvoted.   #funny
== thanks
- You stretch along the promenade windows with a few early risers while the stars slide past. Breakfast tastes better after.
== chatter
- Sunrise stretch tomorrow. Set an alarm.
- I go to sunrise stretch for the windows, honestly.   #warm
- My back's better since I started the stretch.
